  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a1a04623d493881",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp 使用 --load-mode mmap 时占用了 21-32 GB 的 RAM，而 ik_llama.cpp 占用了 106-108 GB。-sm tensor 把我的预填充性能搞垮了，改成 -sm layer 后，速度从 36 tps 提升到了 135 tps。之后，在 -c 131072 下，-ubatch 2048 又将速度推到了 400 tps。在 -c 262144 下，我的内存容量容不下 -ubatch 2048，这就是为什么在 262144 的上下文长度下，我这里的速度最高只能达到约 180-200 tps 的预填充和 12 tps 的解码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ec4e64beb82e938",
      "translationZh": "在本地测试、最初获得 14-15 tps 的解码速度后，我却卡在了 36 tps 的预填充速度上，这对我来说根本没法用。我调整了很多设置，却仍然没能改善这个数值，于是决定在本地跑一批基准测试。结果让我很惊讶，所以我决定把它们发出来，让其他人也能从这些结果中受益。所有测试都使用了在我的 CachyOS 系统上本地编译的 llama.cpp 和 ik_llama.cpp 二进制程序。CUDA 0 使用 16x PCI 通道，全部 12 GB 显存都可用；而 CUDA 1 负责运行我的桌面 UI，使用 4x PCI 通道，通常在空闲时占用 1.5/12 GB 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f338e27a7f30bb9d",
      "translationZh": "这条线以下的所有内容都是 AI 生成的基准测试结果报告，后面附有原始数据。之所以用 AI 生成，是因为去你妈的；我才不想把那些全都写出来。祝你今天愉快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ee94a0d739ff989",
      "translationZh": "在一台消费级双 GPU 机器上运行 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next UD-IQ4_XS（93.7 GB，125B MoE / 6B 活跃参数）的基准测试数据，对比了 llama.cpp 和 ik_llama.cpp。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf2879c4a9096026",
      "translationZh": "以下所有数据都是在同一台机器上、同一轮测试中测得的。所有预填充数据均来自一个 8k-token 的合成提示词，设置为 cache_prompt: false。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "011165bb2ff15826",
      "translationZh": "-sm tensor 使 llama.cpp 的预填充耗时增至 7 倍。在硬件和其他所有条件完全相同的情况下，使用 -sm tensor 时为 41.7 t/s，使用 -sm layer 时为 303 t/s。对于大小为 32 或以上的批次，llama.cpp 会将驻留在 CPU 上的 MoE 权重所涉及的运算卸载到 GPU，只复制该批次实际使用的专家权重（ggml-backend.cpp:1643）。这条代码路径针对的是单个设备，因此当张量并行拆分将权重分片后，它就不再适用，每个专家的矩阵乘法都会回退到 CPU。实测证据：-sm tensor（35 t/s）与直接禁用运算卸载的 GGML_OP_OFFLOAD_MIN_BATCH=999999（38 t/s）给出了相同的数值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78b62936f5317ee4",
      "translationZh": "预填充期间的监测数据：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e6d55647c35fb47",
      "translationZh": "拆分模式 llama-server CPU GPU0 利用率 GPU1 利用率 预填充",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfc504571c7fb6a2",
      "translationZh": "-ub 是第二个重要的调节参数，但在发现 1 中的问题修复之前，它不起任何作用。在 -sm tensor 下，所有测试过的 ubatch 值都得到了相同的速度。在 -sm layer 下，同样的参数扫描中，512 / 1024 / 2048 对应的速度为 135 / 191 / 303 t/s。这两项修复的效果会相乘。单靠其中任何一项，都远远达不到这样的效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3af76e541ffed38c",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama.cpp 不存在 split-mode 导致的性能断崖。在 ik 上，-sm layer 和 -sm graph 的实测速度相同（407 对 401 t/s）。这个陷阱是 llama.cpp 特有的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8da15b25f865149f",
      "translationZh": "哪个引擎胜出，完全取决于内存是否容得下 -ub 2048。在 -ub 512 和 -ub 1024 下，两个引擎打成平手。ik 在 -ub 2048 下有一条快速路径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1ff56ba94292505",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama.cpp 所需的系统 RAM 比 llama.cpp 多约 75 GB。模型相同，机器相同，参数也相同。llama.cpp 在 --load-mode mmap 下报告已用内存为 21 到 32 GB，可用内存为 93 GB，因为模型的内存页位于页缓存中，可以被回收。ik 报告已用内存为 106 到 108 GB，可用内存仅为 16 到 18 GB。两者都能装进 128 GB 内存，但在一台 96 GB 内存的机器上，这就是 ik 能否运行的区别，而且它几乎不给机器上的其他任务留下余量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd1c97ddfdc076d7",
      "translationZh": "引擎 已用 RAM 可用 RAM 测量环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a665bca770e3e6b",
      "translationZh": "ik_llama.cpp（默认 mmap）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d9435f16d5ffa71",
      "translationZh": "把专家层留在 VRAM 中，不如把空间留给 ubatch 缓冲区划算。在 -ub 512 下，-ncmoe 48 / 46 / 44 对应的速度为 135 / 139 / 141 t/s。把专家移入 VRAM 几乎没有收益，而且会占用足够多的 VRAM，导致 -ub 2048 随后出现 OOM。设置 -ncmoe 48（所有专家都放在 CPU 上），并将 VRAM 用于 ubatch 计算缓冲区，是更好的取舍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82f9425a0dbf3210",
      "translationZh": "解码受内存带宽限制，没有哪个标志能解决这一点。在配备 128 GB DDR5、运行速率为 3200 MT/s（可用带宽约 40 GB/s）的系统上，短上下文下的速度为 12 t/s。作为参考，PR 讨论串报告称，同一模型在配备 12 通道 DDR5 的 EPYC 9555 上可达到 28 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9435cc48bae1b452",
      "translationZh": "增加并行槽位会牺牲单流速度，而对总吞吐量的提升很小。并发槽位从 1 个增加到 4 个时，总吞吐量基本不变；以 --parallel 8 运行服务器时，单流解码速度从约 12 t/s 降至约 5 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4511a36f3a4c338",
      "translationZh": "上下文 引擎 关键标志 预填充 解码 显存（GPU0/GPU1） 系统内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48d94fe0a2b322bf",
      "translationZh": "-sm 层 -ncmoe 48 -ub 2048 -b 4096 -fa 开启",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8eabdaa61a6c8e66",
      "translationZh": "-sm 层 --n-cpu-moe 48 -ub 1024 -b 4096 --flash-attn on",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfc383b0f85910b6",
      "translationZh": "如果你的内存少于约 128 GB，无论上下文大小如何，都应使用 llama.cpp。参见发现 5。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b97ef3945544c92",
      "translationZh": "两者均使用的其他设置：-t 8 -tb 16 , -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 , -ts 60,40 , --parallel 1 。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8cfc1e00ed3eaff",
      "translationZh": "以下做法没有帮助，均经过实测：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0418400e00d8e713",
      "translationZh": "-rtr（ik 运行时重新打包）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd75e2debf26131c",
      "translationZh": "159 t/s 对比 407 t/s。针对 CPU 内核进行优化，但失去了将算子卸载到 GPU 的能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f886a226298552fd",
      "translationZh": "-ictk q8_0（ik 索引器缓存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b0039c7a1c835a5",
      "translationZh": "速度和显存占用均无变化。在 262K + -ub 2048 时仍然出现内存不足",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4c1b18340a9b35b",
      "translationZh": "399 对比 407 t/s，因此 -fmoe 带来的提升约为 2%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c70ed3cca5b7385b",
      "translationZh": "在测试的所有上下文长度下都出现内存不足",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e7d2fc686a9955a",
      "translationZh": "300 对比 303 t/s，一旦由 GPU 执行计算，就没有显著差异",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad1418b968339c8b",
      "translationZh": "KV 缓存使用 q5_1，而非 q8_0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cda2fa46f7d1c5ff",
      "translationZh": "未能释放足够的显存，因此没有改变任何结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a83f67f28fea8c6d",
      "translationZh": "将 -ncmoe 降至 46 或 44",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1edcd6fc4dbdb90c",
      "translationZh": "在 -ub 512 时增加 4 到 6 t/s，而在 -ub 2048 时出现 OOM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2d37cbd69ef74f2",
      "translationZh": "避免在 8 核/16 线程 CPU 上使用 --threads-batch 12。ggml 在每个操作后都设置了同步屏障，因此最终会有 4 个核心各运行 2 个线程，另外 4 个核心各运行 1 个线程，而每个操作都要等待那些运行双线程的核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "170c75f438b4842c",
      "translationZh": "AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D，8 核/16 线程，AVX-512",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b932548d0c8d9a7",
      "translationZh": "128 GB DDR5，运行速率为 3200 MT/s（4x32 GB；安装 4 条 DIMM 时，主板无法以额定速率通过 POST）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad52f8575b089936",
      "translationZh": "RTX 3060 12 GB，PCIe 4.0 x16，直连 CPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f26b571b61ba1ad",
      "translationZh": "RTX 3060 12 GB，PCIe 4.0 x4，经芯片组连接，同时负责桌面显示（约占用 1.3 GB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b2ecb24333afabc",
      "translationZh": "unsloth Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF UD-IQ4_XS，93.7 GB，3 个分片",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0cae7f83c2552473",
      "translationZh": "48 层：36 层 Gated DeltaNet + 12 层 Qwen Sparse Attention，512 个专家，262144 原生上下文",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59ccde4a00e64477",
      "translationZh": "构建版本 4e97ac86e，CUDA 已启用，GGML_NATIVE=ON，架构 86",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e53d3543fb038d39",
      "translationZh": "构建版本 7cff686d（包含 PR #2365 和 #2367 的网格溢出修复）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c022ddeedd971470",
      "translationZh": "已调查 GPU1 上的 x4 链路，并排除其为瓶颈的可能。在缓慢的预填充过程中，两块 GPU 的利用率都接近 0%，因此该链路始终未达到饱和。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00268a59693dcfcc",
      "translationZh": "上下文 131072，8k 提示词，-b 4096 -t 8 -tb 16 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0，--load-mode mmap。VRAM 为 nvidia-smi 显示的已用显存，在服务器已加载且基准测试刚结束时采样。RAM 为整个系统的已用内存，其中包含桌面环境占用的约 6 GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a7bb37b437e6843c",
      "translationZh": "-sm -ncmoe -ub -tb 预填充 t/s 解码 t/s GPU0 MiB GPU1 MiB RAM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8daf35a235f62ac",
      "translationZh": "P 行是在 L 行的基础上设置 GGML_OP_OFFLOAD_MIN_BATCH=999999，这会禁用算子卸载。A 行和 G 行的 VRAM 数据是在运行过程中实时采样的，而非在测试结束时采样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bec69d5300d3ad08",
      "translationZh": "-sm -ncmoe -ub -ts 预填充 t/s 解码 t/s GPU0 MiB GPU1 MiB RAM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74ebd7b07feac896",
      "translationZh": "加载失败的 llama.cpp 配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a1708a602de68e3",
      "translationZh": "ctx -sm -ncmoe -ub -ts 失败原因",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2982fdf0c8d73b6",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 1 上为 12281 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6d030fbfbd0255e",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 1 上为 3888 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1e20b8bb50586c2",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 1 上为 7776 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d2270dbbe0519d9",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 1 上为 7216 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20a7d6a6e968bd0e",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 0 上为 6920 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28fda545bbadadc7",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 1 上为 7200 MiB（KV 使用 q5_1）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85afe79699599ba2",
      "translationZh": "上下文长度如所注明，提示词长度为 8k，-ncmoe 48 -b 4096 -t 8 -tb 16 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 -fa on -ts 60,40。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "38902c6b9de79bee",
      "translationZh": "ctx -sm -ub 附加选项 预填充 t/s 解码 t/s GPU0 MiB GPU1 MiB RAM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b214b7c7f63be48",
      "translationZh": "IKM 各行就是后来重新运行的 IK1、IK3 和 IK8，只是增加了内存使用情况的记录。重复测得的结果相差不超过 2 t/s（405 对 407、178 对 179、136 对 136），这有助于检验这些测量结果的可重复性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10f3f94fc2044af9",
      "translationZh": "ik 占用的常驻 RAM 远多于 llama.cpp。ik 的已用内存为 106 到 108 GB，可用内存为 16 到 18 GB；而 llama.cpp 在使用 --load-mode mmap 时，已用内存为 21 到 32 GB，可用内存为 93 GB，因为它的模型内存页留在页缓存中，而不是被计入已用内存。同一个模型，同一台机器。在一台配备 128 GB 内存的机器上，ik 仍然能装得下，但留给其他任务的余量就小得多，因此在内存更少的机器上运行 ik 之前，值得先检查一下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c32f282a0942031",
      "translationZh": "加载失败的 ik_llama.cpp 配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "556134b319ee6738",
      "translationZh": "ctx -ub -ts 附加选项 失败情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ced684e0f894f10f",
      "translationZh": "OOM，设备 0 上为 7254 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c0948b86082bc6b",
      "translationZh": "内存不足（OOM），设备 0 上为 8278 MiB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e6c9229ad19fceb",
      "translationZh": "相同设置下的引擎对比",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60b93cde4f7e0205",
      "translationZh": "上下文 131072，-ncmoe 48，8k 提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b7d0747c4929e53",
      "translationZh": "上下文 262144，-ncmoe 48，-ub 1024。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a51cc4876e95d73",
      "translationZh": "预填充和解码随提示词深度的变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "696a86c6f60082aa",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp，上下文 262144，-ncmoe 48 -ub 1024 -sm layer -ts 60,40，单个 59k 提示词。数值为服务器在每个 4096-token 边界处报告的累计平均值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3efa14b46e1a23a6",
      "translationZh": "Token 数 预填充 t/s # Token 数 预填充 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "153a21e8d2a981ef",
      "translationZh": "在同一次运行中，解码速度从提示长度为 8k 时的 12 t/s 降至 59k 时的 8 t/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1326ce5330461f5",
      "translationZh": "用 t = a*n + b*n^2/2 拟合这条曲线，得到 a = 4.47e-3 和 b = 3.24e-8，据此外推，完整的 262144-token 冷预填充过程平均速度约为 115 t/s，耗时约 38 分钟。这是基于 59k 数据的外推，并非直接测量结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d7811f8593ed76a",
      "translationZh": "PR 讨论串将这种速度衰减归因于稀疏注意力索引器的池化块开销随缓存长度增长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dad46ea5c418cbae",
      "translationZh": "llama.cpp，上下文长度 262144，--parallel 4，同时发起四个 4k 提示，每个生成 128 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa8b2898940d51cc",
      "translationZh": "并发数 每槽位预填充 t/s 每槽位解码 t/s 总预填充 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee8f96564de5c9a9",
      "translationZh": "单独测试解码，上下文长度 65536，--parallel 8，极简提示，每个生成 64 个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a960a721bbecb7e",
      "translationZh": "并发数 每槽位解码 t/s 总解码 t/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "699c9729d538ac60",
      "translationZh": "请注意：在 --parallel 8 服务器上，单槽位解码速度为 4.96 t/s，而在 --parallel 1 服务器上约为 12 t/s。预留槽位即使处于空闲状态，也会降低速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8e919b5f4c04f5c",
      "translationZh": "在根据微小差异得出结论之前，请先阅读以下说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33fa21b13334772c",
      "translationZh": "每项测试只运行一次，没有重复测试。不同运行之间的波动约为 10%。llama.cpp 在 -ub 1024 下，使用 131K 上下文时测得 191 t/s，使用 262K 上下文时却测得 215 t/s，这与预期相反，表明了噪声底限。只有较大的效应（split-mode 的 7 倍差距、ubatch 带来的 2.2 倍至 3 倍效应，以及 ik 在 -ub 2048 下的 34% 领先幅度）才明显超出了这一范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a4eda774497d410",
      "translationZh": "所有基准测试均在禁用推测解码的情况下运行。在实际使用中，对重复性较强的编程内容采用 --spec-type ngram-mod 时，解码速度应高于这里给出的数值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13176cf9f1c3abf9",
      "translationZh": "解码速度仅基于生成的 64 个 token 测量，样本量较小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081dda991c492e95",
      "translationZh": "4 槽位并行解码的数据噪声较大，2 槽位的成绩低于 1 槽位就说明了这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c94a0c0ca1be5db",
      "translationZh": "所有接受基准测试的配置都未使用 --n-cpu-ffn。建议去掉它，是根据它从未出现在这些配置中推断出来的，而非基于 A/B 测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d431ddb7c13cac7",
      "translationZh": "ik 在 -ub 2048 下领先 34% 的原因尚未确定。-fmoe 解释了其中约 2% 的领先幅度。其余 32% 尚未追溯到具体机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b7c7007021fb8e7",
      "translationZh": "完整的 262144-token 预填充数据是外推得到的，而非实测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94a7715c7f2a2525",
      "translationZh": "内存数据来自 nvidia-smi 和 free 的全系统读数，因此包含桌面及其他进程的占用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7f341c488f8ac0f",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Comrade_Mugabe 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
